<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田病院外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">'s parents got to the hospital around the time evening came.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The tests showed that </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">'s injury wasn't that serious, and apparently she could leave the hospital tomorrow.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were both tied up with police questioning today and had no time for me, so together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I planned to spend the time at the hospital with </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When we asked the hospital to let us stay overnight with her, they agreed surprisingly easily.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">With us there, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">'s parents probably felt relieved too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">'s parents, to pick up </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others, were going to wait at the police station until the questioning was over.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Well then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, sorry, but I'm leaving her to you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Sorry about this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Sure, leave it to me! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s here too, so no need to worry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to be struggling to get some words out.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Uh... </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, how they're related..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, let's save that talk for after we get back to Motoki-cho..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Sorry, I overstepped..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"So you've both heard..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Oh, but don't let it bother you! It's not like anything's gonna change between us from now on just because of that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Hunh...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2,人物1,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was also going to wait at the police station for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so she set off together with </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">'s parents.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After seeing the three of them off, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I went back to </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">'s hospital room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\なつみ病室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\割れた能面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">, on the bed, had picked up the Grand Witch's Noh mask and was gazing at it intently.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it, would that have to be turned in to the police too?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We'd ended up bringing it all the way to the hospital along with </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Did <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> and the others go?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah. They said they'll come again tomorrow when you're discharged."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It wasn't even that bad an injury, but it turned into such a big deal..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Saying that, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> looked back at the Noh mask.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Did <STYLE ID="4">Erika-chan</STYLE> see this coming when she entrusted the Noh mask to me...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Who knows. I guess she just... wanted to help </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="7"> out, even a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Not just a little, though. It ended up saving my life."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The Grand Witch's Noh mask had a big gash in it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To think a sturdy metal Noh mask could get crushed this badly... that Droga stuff really is powerful...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmmm..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Wh-what!? Staring at my face like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Just thinking, if <STYLE ID="7">this person</STYLE> were my older sister, I'd be happy after all."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"A-are you an idiot!? Don't stare!"</STYLE><PG>
"Would <STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE> hate it if I were your little sister?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I wouldn't hate it, but...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　But still... it's just..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I'd be happy if you two were sisters!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Sisters who get along... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">I envy them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh... yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't get along with her </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">older sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, now that I think of it...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I'd better not bring up this kind of thing with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hm? Hm? Could it be you thought I'd feel awkward seeing how close you two are!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Huh...!? No..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't worry about it! I love how well you two get along!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　So please keep getting along, the two of you, and keep me company from now on too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Of course, <STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE>! We don't need to hold back with each other!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Th-th-th-that's right! It's not awkward or anything!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There was a time when I was being bullied in Megasawa City and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had shut herself away in her own shell.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> blew all that away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> both, it's because </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> is here that we are who we are now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's only as the three of us that we can be who we are now.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"All right! It's a little early, but this is </STYLE>your<STYLE ID="7"> get-well celebration!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　We'll toast with this stuff!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カップ置く音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸ボンバー3本.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I took out three bottles of Super Soda Bomber that I hadn't gotten around to drinking.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\惑星宝石箱.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... I'm not good with that stuff..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"You're going to make an injured person drink that...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"You guys! You're making fun of Super Soda Bomber!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Every single one of you, why can't you see how great this is!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Come to think of it, there's sometimes some of that in our fridge. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I think it's probably my </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">big sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s, but she might hit it off with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"For real, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!? Finally, someone who gets it! Introduce me later!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"W-well, if I get the chance..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I guess even sisters really do have pretty different tastes in things like this..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="7">!</STYLE> If you<STYLE ID="7"> really are my little sister, I'm definitely gonna make you like this stuff!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I-if you're going to say that, then I'm going to make <STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE> like spicy food and coffee and stuff too!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Are you trying to kill me!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We kept horsing around like this for a while, until a nurse told us off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That night we got told, 'Make noise one more time and you're getting thrown out!' and we finally settled down.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No matter how we're related, I'm sure that from now on too, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> will still be my best friend.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, too, will still be my dependable, cute junior.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田病院外観昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Shiyo 800, April 9, 10 o'clock―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, whatever you do, drive safely."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's fiiine, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Just leave it to meee!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, give us a call when you want to take a break. Let's all stop at the same roadside rest stop."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, okaaay!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The three of us got into </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s car was roomier, so the idea was that it would be easier on </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Assuming she drives safely, that is...</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAITPLAY "BGM" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車室内エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ワゴン昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―After we'd driven for a while, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> fell asleep in the back seat.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They probably hadn't slept well, staying overnight in an unfamiliar hospital.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... about us..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
